WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.961
This is an octopus.

2
00:00:14.962 --> 00:00:20.347
The octopus sprays ink.

3
00:00:20.348 --> 00:00:25.075
This is a shark.

4
00:00:25.076 --> 00:00:30.543
The shark has sharp teeth.

5
00:00:30.544 --> 00:00:35.133
This is a whale.

6
00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:41.870
The whale shoots water into the air.

7
00:00:41.871 --> 00:00:46.367
This is a turtle.

8
00:00:46.368 --> 00:00:52.022
The turtle has a hard shell.

9
00:00:52.023 --> 00:00:57.284
This is a starfish.

10
00:00:57.285 --> 00:01:02.559
The starfish has five legs.

11
00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:07.674
This is an angelfish.

12
00:01:07.675 --> 00:01:13.312
The angelfish has beautiful colors.

13
00:01:13.313 --> 00:01:18.473
This is a lobster.

14
00:01:18.474 --> 00:01:24.010
The lobster has strong claws.

15
00:01:24.011 --> 00:01:28.659
This is a jellyfish.

16
00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:34.265
The jellyfish has a soft body.

17
00:01:34.266 --> 00:01:37.245
They are different.

18
00:01:37.246 --> 00:01:43.629
But all of them live in the sea.
